@token = demo-token

### Simple GET
# @name ip
GET {{baseUrl}}/get?client=zed
Accept: application/json

### POST JSON with dynamic variables
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{$uuid}}",
  "createdAt": "{{$isoTimestamp}}",
  "score": {{$randomInt 1 100}}
}

### Use a value from a previous response
GET {{baseUrl}}/headers
X-Request-Id: {{created.response.body.json.id}}

### Basic auth (IntelliJ shorthand)
GET {{baseUrl}}/basic-auth/user/passwd
Authorization: Basic user passwd

### Save response to file
GET {{baseUrl}}/uuid

>> ./out/uuid.json
